Fails to parse JSON whose arrays and objects nest more than 256 deep, with
kParseErrorDepth. The recursive parser uses about 66 bytes of stack per level,
so a deeply nested document overflowed the thread's stack and crashed: a
128 KB musl thread held about 1,900 levels. The limit also bounds everything
that walks a parsed document recursively afterwards, such as converting it to
a value or a GeoJSON geometry, and freeing it
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1475).
Upstream: not proposed

